    "body": "Sorry, no, crossed wires there.. AFAIK, a/area bits do _not_ work in existing implementations -- well, maybe with exception of prefetch in some browsers (need to test). Rather, my comment was: if we support prefetch on a/area, it probably makes sense to extend that to other RH primitives.\n\nAlternatively, we could remove the a/area stuff altogether. _(shrug)_\n",
